{
  "pack": {
    "_comment": [
      "Combined resource + data pack manifest for a NeoOrigins UI theme.",
      "",
      "Pack formats for 26.1:",
      "  - 84  resource pack",
      "  - 101  data pack",
      "",
      "min_format/max_format cover both, so one zip serves as a resource",
      "pack and a data pack without a version-mismatch warning. Drop this",
      "whole 'theme-template' folder (renamed to your pack's name) into a",
      ".zip with pack.mcmeta at the root, then place the zip in:",
      "",
      "  - .minecraft/resourcepacks/   (so the textures/font/theme JSON load)",
      "  - <world>/datapacks/          (so the active_theme.json applies)",
      "",
      "Or, even simpler: ship the theme as a NeoForge mod jar and the",
      "originpacks/ folder will pick it up automatically on both sides."
    ],
    "description": "NeoOrigins UI theme",
    "pack_format": 101,
    "min_format": 84,
    "max_format": 101
  }
}
